3731   gamma_CO2(ene,j,z)   Adjustment speed parameter – governs how rapidly emissions intensity responds to changes in carbon price
3732   MINCO2FACTOR(ene,j,z) minimum CO2 emission factor
3733   CTAX_CO2(ene,j,z,time)
3734   CO2FACTOR2_Star(ene,j,z,time)
3735  ;
